stateDiagram-v2
 [*] --> active
 state active {
  [*] --> waiting_dependencies
  waiting_dependencies --> ready: 依赖接受
  ready --> running: 预算与租约就绪
  running --> waiting_tool: 调用工具
  waiting_tool --> running
  running --> waiting_user: 必要选择
  waiting_user --> ready: 明确答复
  running --> validating: 提交候选
  validating --> running
 }
 active --> invalidated: 依赖变化并撤销旧租约
 active --> cancelled: 取消并隔离迟到结果
 active --> failed: 不可恢复或耗尽预算
 validating --> accepted: 本地检查通过
 accepted --> invalidated: 依赖版本变化
 failed --> [*]
 cancelled --> [*]
 invalidated --> [*]
